{
	"nodes": [
		{
			"id": "4b80c9e2e5e4aa6f",
			"type": "group",
			"label": "wiki-draft (agent): a slice of subjects in, writes out",
			"x": -1300,
			"y": -500,
			"width": 1880,
			"height": 1200,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "1200e4bd29bc5262",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "docs/design/Entities/Match Map.md",
			"x": -1760,
			"y": -200,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 400,
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "d96a7674fe74c05f",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "For each subject in the slice",
			"x": -1240,
			"y": -30,
			"width": 250,
			"height": 60,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "08776ee2e9418138",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "`new`",
			"x": -880,
			"y": -330,
			"width": 160,
			"height": 60,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "c72222f7ad6310bc",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "`near`",
			"x": -880,
			"y": -30,
			"width": 160,
			"height": 60,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "8d08a57a33c26a77",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "`hit`",
			"x": -880,
			"y": 300,
			"width": 160,
			"height": 60,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "ffd7a6cff852ebf4",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Should the wiki hold this subject? (the gates)",
			"x": -620,
			"y": -350,
			"width": 270,
			"height": 100,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "3f72c885e4c756a9",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**create** a page in the source's scope, cited",
			"x": -200,
			"y": -440,
			"width": 270,
			"height": 80,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "3e6692e4adc8be6d",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**skip**, with the reason",
			"x": -200,
			"y": -300,
			"width": 270,
			"height": 60,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "0ad7f1da0c9f9b3a",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Read each neighbor. Is one of them the same subject?",
			"x": -620,
			"y": -50,
			"width": 270,
			"height": 100,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "489f1c0d8a8f1fce",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Treat it as a **hit** on that page; add the name as an alias",
			"x": -200,
			"y": -110,
			"width": 270,
			"height": 90,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "cb338e80193ef1e5",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Treat it as **new**; link the closest neighbor under Related",
			"x": -200,
			"y": 20,
			"width": 270,
			"height": 90,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "4face6e69a2c7a83",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Read the page. Do the items add information?",
			"x": -620,
			"y": 190,
			"width": 270,
			"height": 90,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "4dfe6d90d6eb2148",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**modify**: merge the claims, cite them, keep the clearer description",
			"x": -200,
			"y": 170,
			"width": 270,
			"height": 100,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "6d1d961a64ffa0e7",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Do they confirm a claim the page makes?",
			"x": -620,
			"y": 340,
			"width": 270,
			"height": 80,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "320cbea5fa36498e",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**modify**: add the citation",
			"x": -200,
			"y": 330,
			"width": 270,
			"height": 60,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "5b61d67073d8a23d",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**skip**",
			"x": -200,
			"y": 430,
			"width": 270,
			"height": 60,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "d5b101ef708d5033",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "They contradict the page: **modify**, keep both claims, set `contested`",
			"x": -200,
			"y": 540,
			"width": 270,
			"height": 100,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "21034a230ab6308a",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**source** read, when a claim needs the text around it",
			"x": -1240,
			"y": 300,
			"width": 250,
			"height": 90,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "0657ec4d4360fa53",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Accumulate the writes and the skipped subjects",
			"x": 240,
			"y": -40,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 80,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "a81ee0e9fa3736f1",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "docs/design/Entities/Wiki Change Plan.md",
			"x": 640,
			"y": -200,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 400,
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "c89c2ecede02a5cc",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Changed from the first draft: a `near` subject whose neighbor is a different subject used to be skipped. It now goes the `new` way, so no subject is lost in silence.",
			"x": 640,
			"y": 260,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 140
		},
		{
			"id": "41849eee01dd81fa",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Legend**\n\n- cyan: tool (code)\n- yellow: skill or agent (model)\n- purple: document or entity\n- green: hook (code, automatic)\n- orange: the user\n- red: a gate or a refusal",
			"x": -1760,
			"y": -620,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 260
		}
	],
